From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.applicationmodel: Windows.ApplicationModel.Resources.Core.ResourceManager

NanaZip's file manager gets its strings through ResourceManager.Current; the class did not exist. ResourceManager.Current, its MainResourceMap and DefaultContext, a map's values (GetValue, GetValueForContext) and subtrees, a candidate's string, IsResourceReference -- over the same resources.pri index the ResourceLoader reads; a resource that does not exist is ERROR_MRM_NAMED_RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND. Interface definitions (IIDs, method order, parameters) per windows-rs 0.100 (MIT), written into our own IDL; the implementation is ours.
---
